# NHL 19: extra settings for the game, KEY=value, one per line. The launcher's settings are in
# sacredfire.ini (the launcher window writes it); a line here sets what the launcher doesn't,
# and a variable set in the environment when starting wins over both. Examples:

# The monitor: its number (1, 2, ...) or part of its name
#BB_DISPLAY=2
# Holding Circle for 2 seconds asks "Quit NHL 19?": 0 turns it off
#BB_HOLD_CIRCLE_QUIT=0
